    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32392" root="غمر" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمَرٌ</span></b>  <i>A drowning; being drowned:</i> so in the
phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْتُ الغَمَرِ</span> <i>Death by drowning.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمْرٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  The <i>foul smell of flesh-meat,</i> (S,
Mgh, K,) <i>and its grease adhering to the hand:</i>
(K:) and the <i>smell of fish.</i> (S.) Hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْدِيلُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الغَمَرِ</span> (S, Mgh) <i>The napkin,</i> or <i>rough napkin,
with which the hand is cleansed therefrom.</i> (L,
TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A4-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُمْرٌ</span>, in two places.

